  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "活動、Prompt 事件與 Trace 的資料界線",
      "description": "說明這張 dashboard 能查閱的 metadata、Tempo 關聯方式，以及刻意不保留的敏感內容。",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### 查得到事件與 trace，查不到也不保存 prompt 原文\n\ncodex.user_prompt 證明 prompt 提交事件發生，並保留時間、provider／product／model 與 trace_id 等安全 metadata。Collector 會把 log body 固定改成 **AI telemetry metadata event**，raw prompt、assistant response、tool arguments/results、command output、source code 與路徑都不會進入此 dashboard。展開 log details 可複製 trace_id，再由下方 Tempo trace 清單或 Explore 追查執行路徑。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "全部 Metadata 事件",
      "description": "所選服務與時間範圍內具有 event_name 的 metadata-only log 數。",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": ""
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({service_name=~\"$service_name\"} | event_name != \"\" [$__range]))",
          "queryType": "instant",
          "legendFormat": "事件"
        }
      ]
    },
